  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing business skills of female entrepreneurs in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has two purposes. The first purpose is to strengthen the business and personal skills of 16 Indian female start-up tech entrepreneurs. Organising a visit to the Netherlands will help achieve this purpose. During the visit, the group receives:1)	Business training and activities by leading Dutch tech companies and organisations and;2)	Insight into best practices through discussions with Dutch female entrepreneurs active in India and Dutch women&apos;s business networks.The second purpose is to enable the Netherlands Embassy to learn more about the needs and challenges of Indian female entrepreneurs and to strengthen the ties between stakeholders in the Netherlands and India regarding female entrepreneurship by embedding female entrepreneurship further in its network and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
